<!-- Folder colour of every system icon. Read by tools/make_system_icons.py, which draws the folder in that colour and puts
     _inc/system_glyphs/<system>.svg on top of it. Not loaded by EmulationStation. To recolour a folder, change its "color";
     to add a colour, add a <color> (top / bottom of the vertical gradient, the ORIGINAL saturated values: the pastel mix is applied by the script). -->
